config ZMK_ESP32_PROFILE_NAMING
    bool "Per-profile BT device name suffix"
    default n
    select BT_DEVICE_NAME_DYNAMIC
    help
      When enabled the BT device name is changed to "<BT_DEVICE_NAME>-BT<N>"
      whenever the active BLE profile changes. Hosts must re-pair to see the
      new name.

